==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|sweben|swëben|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|sweben|swebēn|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|swibēną||to move|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{recons|sweyp-|lang=ine-pro}}, {{recons|sweyb-||to twist, turn around|lang=ine-pro}}. Cognate with {{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|zweven||to float|lang=nl}}.

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|schwebt|schwebte|geschwebt|auxiliary=sein}}

# to [[hover]], to [[float]]

